err_enumlit.vuka:35:19: <Button variant="outlien">: "outlien" is no Variant; Variant takes the value of one of its constants: "", "outline", "ghost", or {Variant(x)} for any other; did you mean "outline"?
err_enumlit.vuka:36:19: <Button variant="VariantGhost">: "VariantGhost" is no Variant; Variant takes the value of one of its constants: "", "outline", "ghost", or {Variant(x)} for any other; did you mean "ghost"?
